# Commands run by the launchd job com.hakios.demo (RC_JOBS=rc.jobs.metalpicture).
#
# The render path at the panel's own size (1080x2400), twelve seconds of it, put on the panel:
# the same device, libraries and compiler as rc.jobs.metaldraw, with targets of the screen's
# size instead of 4x4. It says whether the path scales to a full frame and whether the pixels
# reach the display through the runtime's show call (RedwoodMali 0x7f), which is the last step
# before CoreAnimation itself can use Metal.
#
# The watcher returns the phone to Android 90 s after boot; the test starts at 40 s and paints
# for 12.
/redwood/bin/rwtouch wait 40
/redwood/bin/say_run /redwood/bin/metal_props show
/redwood/bin/say_run /redwood/bin/metal_props on
/redwood/bin/say_run /redwood/bin/metal_drv_test --picture 12 /System/Library/Extensions/AppleMetalGLRenderer.bundle/default.metallib
/redwood/bin/say_run /redwood/bin/metal_props off
